stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> QUEUED: User submits offline
    QUEUED --> SYNCING: Online + verified session + lease
    SYNCING --> COMPLETED: API 200/201 terminal
    SYNCING --> RETRYABLE: 5xx / network / lease expired
    RETRYABLE --> SYNCING: Backoff + online
    SYNCING --> FAILED: Definitive 4xx
    FAILED --> [*]
    COMPLETED --> [*]
